From f84fc8a7d83b53eb53d0cf52f2914dc6ebb788fc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: P2ppyJack <P2ppyJack@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 16 Aug 2026 22:49:59 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] feat(journey): conclusion-aware nodes, star-map filters,
 and /recall context drafts

- Honcho journey cards emit the conclusion 'level' (explicit vs
  inductive/deductive); learning_graph carries it as memoryLevel.
  Derived-only nodes render/filter as conclusions (positive-signal
  gate: absent or explicit level stays a memory, so older providers
  degrade safely).
- Star map: kind filters (skills / memories / conclusions / profile),
  provider-aware glyphs and colors, filter state persisted.
- /recall: build_recall_draft() composes a neutralized context draft
  from a node + its connected neighbors; GET /api/learning/recall-draft
  serves it (session-token gated, read-only). Desktop /recall command
  drafts into the composer (active chat or picked session); desktop-only
  builtins now surface in slash autocomplete.
- Tests across every layer (level propagation, isConclusion contract,
  recall draft shape/neutralization, slash completions merge).
